        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.2104 - It is narrated by Ibn Al-Mughira, from Sama'ah, who said:\n\"I asked Abu Abdullah (as) about a person performing i'tikaf who engaged in sexual relations with their spouse.\nImam (as) said: 'They are like one who has broken their fast on a day of Month of Ramadan.'\""
        ]
